    "created_at": "2017-04-19T14:55:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-19T14:55:52Z",
    "body": "This may be clearer if you stop relying on the invalid value default and type `crossorigin=\"anonymous\"`.\r\n\r\nWe've talked about introducing a new attribute, `credentials=omit|same-origin|include` (with invalid/missing value default of omit), but I'm not sure it pulls its own weight.",
