    "updated_at": "2017-04-19T19:23:16Z",
    "body": "I think the new HTTP connection coupled with expectations about the default is more severe than a couple of bytes that could end up compressed in H/2 if they are the same for each request (as a single-byte pointer per https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7541 if I understand things correctly).",
