    "created_at": "2017-08-24T17:36:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-24T17:36:29Z",
    "body": "Just so people are aware, my position is that I would like module scripts to follow fetch(). If fetch changes its defaults, then I think module scripts should too. But if fetch() does not, I'd like to stick with what we have, even with the weird naming.\r\n\r\nIs anyone interested in driving a decision on the fetch side?",
