    "created_at": "2018-04-21T15:29:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-21T15:29:04Z",
    "body": "Hmm, the top-level fetch needs to be same-origin, but what about the imports? `importScripts()` can go cross-origin, so I guess they should be able to do that too? Basically the same as a service worker?\r\n\r\nIt's probably best if @domenic fixes this since he has a much better handle on the various algorithms, but I'm willing to do the work given some feedback on all of the above.",
